      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CREAM (1) stuck on well last time to finish 1.2 lengths back in second (23.11) at Geelong in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 over 400m. Capable of going well again. PAW LARA (4) struggled to get involved last start after missing the jump at Warragul, but prior to that won by a neck at Warrnambool (22.58) beating Bush Jewel in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 on July 27. Can do much better this time. SELECT MILLS (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Warragul behind Goosebumps Rico (23.13) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Expected to be in the finish again. WORDS (2) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
